{"root":{"data":{"id":"djtba9lw9nk0","created":1783526235819,"text":"数据存储","priority":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djtbbbk1h3s0","created":1783526318425,"text":"目前架构","layout_mind_offset":{"x":62.83333256261187,"y":-143.16666099015225}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djtbbute5o80","created":1783526360349,"text":"服务器数据->PlayerController->个体使用"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbcnhjnfk0","created":1783526422759,"text":"痛点：PlayerController负责的内容太多太杂，负责RPC大量函数的转接，会有很多的代码干扰，我认为PlayerController应该当作中转站，影响判断，模块化有助于项目的理解"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbjnstcu80","created":1783526971990,"text":"痛点2：个体获取的数据应该共用一块内存，避免各自从云端复制一块独立的内存下来。因此需缓存数据并封装数据获取接口，而在playerController里封装则会导致单个代码文件过大且由于功能多样，容易混淆"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbnm0zztc0","created":1783527281588,"text":"痛点3：目前数据采用一个PlayerData的表存储，过于宽泛"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djtbd60e7w00","created":1783526463081,"text":"优化后的架构","layout_mind_offset":{"x":532.3333031651061,"y":109.58332832074848}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djtbdckxvc80","created":1783526477384,"text":"服务器数据->PlayerPropertyComponent缓存->个体使用","layout_right_offset":{"x":611.2499817833308,"y":-1.249999962747097}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbirn92qw0","created":1783526901997,"text":"痛点1，2优化：PlayerPropertyComponent只负责数据存储这单一责职。缓存数据，封装数据获取函数，封装数据存储函数，共用一块数据内存，避免数据丢失的情况","layout_right_offset":{"x":1178.7499648705134,"y":4.999999850988331}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbovl55bc0","created":1783527380761,"text":"痛点3优化：对玩家数据进行二级分类:","layout_right_offset":{"x":499.99998509883903,"y":39.999998807907104}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djtbq415vyw0","created":1783527477508,"text":"1. State_Data(用于判断玩家的状态量，如是否登录注册过)","layout_right_offset":{"x":652.4999805539851,"y":-16.24999951571226}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbqez6oqw0","created":1783527501333,"text":"2.Resouce_Data(用于存储自定义的资源，如金币)","layout_right_offset":{"x":607.4999818950896,"y":1.2499999627473244}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbre7krj40","created":1783527578028,"text":"3.Building_Data(用于存储基地培养的进度, 如健身房等级)","layout_right_offset":{"x":651.2499805912379,"y":19.99999940395378}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbsiibthc0","created":1783527665749,"text":"4.Property_Data(用于存储玩家的属性, 如生命值，搜刮速度)","layout_right_offset":{"x":664.9999801814561,"y":37.49999888241257}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbt8qd5g80","created":1783527722832,"text":"5.后续自定义扩展方便","layout_right_offset":{"x":462.49998621642607,"y":59.99999821186077}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbtmrq6pc0","created":1783527753389,"text":"6.生命周期：在玩家进入游戏后->获取State_Data进行初始化判断->根据判断选择加载还是新建玩家数据","layout_right_offset":{"x":899.9999731779103,"y":96.24999713152647}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djtbvvpj8wg0","created":1783527929576,"text":"未来痛点预估以及解决","layout_right_offset":{"x":332.49999009072803,"y":157.49999530613434}},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}